&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4478&quot;&gt;Language skills:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4496&quot;&gt; Native-level or completely fluent written and spoken German, and professional fluency in English.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
