&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PsiQuantum&#39;s mission is to build the first useful quantum computers: machines capable of delivering the breakthroughs the field has long promised. Since our founding in 2016, our singular focus has been to build and deploy million-qubit, fault-tolerant quantum systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Quantum computers harness the laws of quantum mechanics to solve problems that even the most advanced supercomputers or AI systems will never reach. Their impact will span energy, pharmaceuticals, finance, agriculture, transportation, materials, and other foundational industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our architecture&amp;nbsp;and approach&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;based on silicon photonics. By&amp;nbsp;leveraging&amp;nbsp;the advanced semiconductor manufacturing industry, including partners like GlobalFoundries, we use the same high-volume processes that already produce billions of chips for telecom and consumer electronics. Photonics offers natural advantages for scale: photons&amp;nbsp;don&#39;t&amp;nbsp;feel heat, are immune to electromagnetic interference, and integrate with existing cryogenic cooling and standard fiber-optic infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;That approach has since been tested at the highest level of scrutiny the U.S. government applies to emerging technology, and it has held up. In 2025,&amp;nbsp;PsiQuantum&amp;nbsp;closed a&amp;nbsp;$1 billion&amp;nbsp;funding round that valued the company at&amp;nbsp;$7 billion. In 2026, the U.S. Department of Commerce signed a $100 million Letter of Intent under the CHIPS and Science Act, followed by a $125 million agreement with DARPA under Stage C of its Quantum Benchmarking Initiative,&amp;nbsp;PsiQuantum&#39;s&amp;nbsp;most valuable U.S. government agreement to date. This year, we also broke ground on our utility-scale quantum computer in Brisbane, Australia, and continued building out our Chicago site. Victor Peng, our CEO, and co-founder Jeremy O&#39;Brien, now Executive&amp;nbsp;Chairman, lead a team and board that reflects how seriously the world is taking this build, joined this year by Intel&#39;s Lip-Bu Tan and Atomico&#39;s Niklas&amp;nbsp;Zennström.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PsiQuantum&amp;nbsp;also develops the algorithms and software needed to make these systems commercially valuable. Our application, software, and industry teams work directly with leading Fortune 500 companies, including&amp;nbsp;Airbus,&amp;nbsp;Lockheed&amp;nbsp;Martin, Mercedes-Benz, Boehringer Ingelheim, and Mitsubishi Chemical, to prepare quantum solutions for real-world impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Quantum computing is not an extension of classical computing. It&amp;nbsp;represents&amp;nbsp;a fundamental shift, and a path to mastering challenges that cannot be&amp;nbsp;solved&amp;nbsp;any other way. The potential is enormous, and we now have&amp;nbsp;the funding,&amp;nbsp;the government&amp;nbsp;validation, and&amp;nbsp;the sites&amp;nbsp;under construction to make it real.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;PsiQuantum is building the world’s first useful, fault-tolerant quantum computer. Our applications team focuses on developing algorithms and workflows in the fault-tolerant regime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;183&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Quantum Applications Software Manager to lead a small, high-impact team of Quantum Applications Software Developers. This team builds the software tools and infrastructure that enable the development, evaluation, and deployment of quantum applications for real-world problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;478&quot;&gt;In this role, you will combine hands-on software engineering with team leadership. You will work closely with quantum algorithm developers and architects to deliver scalable, high-quality tools—such as simulators, resource estimators, and compilation workflows—that are critical to turning quantum algorithms into practical solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Lead and Develop a High-Performing Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;44&quot;&gt;Manage, mentor, and support a team of quantum applications software developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;44&quot;&gt;Provide clear direction, set priorities, and ensure alignment with team goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;44&quot;&gt;Foster a collaborative, inclusive, and execution-focused team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;287&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Drive Execution and Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate team objectives into actionable plans and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day execution, ensuring projects are delivered on time and to a high standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify risks and remove blockers to maintain team momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;550&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Contribute Technically&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;576&quot;&gt;Remain hands-on in the design, development, and deployment of quantum applications software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;576&quot;&gt;Guide technical decisions and support the team in solving complex engineering challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;576&quot;&gt;Promote strong software engineering practices, including testing, code quality, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;873&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Build Quantum Applications Tooling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;911&quot;&gt;Oversee development of core tools such as quantum simulators, resource estimation frameworks, circuit compilation pipelines, and domain-specific application integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;911&quot;&gt;Support the development of scalable and reliable simulation and compute infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Collaborate Across Teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1206&quot;&gt;Partner closely with quantum applications architects, algorithm researchers, and other engineering teams to implement software solutions for real-world use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1206&quot;&gt;Contribute to cross-functional efforts that connect algorithms, software, and hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1465&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Enable Quantum Algorithm Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1505&quot;&gt;Support analysis and optimization of resource requirements for fault-tolerant quantum computations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1505&quot;&gt;Help enable improvements in quantum algorithms through robust and flexible software tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience/Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;MSc or PhD in Physics, Mathematics, Computer Science, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience in quantum computing, quantum algorithms, or quantum circuit compilation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;5+ years of professional software engineering experience, including building and maintaining production-quality systems (Python, C++, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience leading projects and/or mentoring engineers; prior people management experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience with distributed systems, cloud infrastructure, or API-driven architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Familiarity with fault-tolerant quantum computing and resource estimation is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;605&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Key attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;623&quot;&gt;A hands-on leader who enjoys both coding and developing people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;623&quot;&gt;Strong execution skills, with the ability to turn objectives into delivered outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;623&quot;&gt;Pragmatic problem solver with a focus on impact and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;623&quot;&gt;Effective collaborator who can work across disciplines and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;623&quot;&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced, evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PsiQuantum provides equal employment opportunity for all applicants and employees. PsiQuantum does not unlawfully discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), gender identity, gender expression, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, physical or mental disability, military or veteran status, marital status, domestic partner status, sexual orientation, genetic information, or any other basis protected by applicable laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Note: PsiQuantum will only reach out to you using an official PsiQuantum email address and will never ask you for bank account information as part of the interview process. Please report any suspicious activity to &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; ----- ----- data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are not accepting unsolicited resumes from employment agencies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The ranges below reflect the target ranges for a new hire base salary.&amp;nbsp;Actual compensation may vary outside of these ranges and is dependent on various factors including but not limited to a candidate&#39;s qualifications including relevant education and training, competencies, experience, geographic location, and business needs. Base pay is only one part of the total compensation package. Full time roles are eligible for equity and benefits. Base pay is subject to change and may be modified in the future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Daresbury, United Kingdom &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£99,400&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£116,900 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About THG Ingenuity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THG Ingenuity is a proprietary Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) technology, robotics, and operations platform built for global ecommerce. Developed through more than two decades of operating ecommerce and retail services at scale, its software and automation capabilities have been engineered, tested, and refined through the real-world demands of managing complex commerce operations. Today, THG Ingenuity provides an integrating operating environment that enables brands to intelligently optimise the entire commerce lifecycle from browsing and checkout to AI inventory management and forecasting, automated fulfilment, carrier control, and customer experience. The platform comprises:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THG Fulfil: The fulfilment operating system for global ecommerce. Delivered via a proprietary SaaS and Robotics-as-a-Service (RaaS) model, THG Fulfil orchestrates every stage of checkout, fulfilment, delivery, and customer experience through an integrated system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THG Studios: The UK&#39;s most innovative creative hub, helping brands create content that connects, experiences that engage, and IP that scales, all from its end-to-end, in-house facilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THG Commerce: A cloud-native technology stack enabling retailers and brands to create intelligent, AI-powered, digital shopping experiences, while integrated marketplace and social commerce functionality allows brands to reach customers across every sales channel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With its expertise in building and scaling brands, THG Ingenuity is uniquely positioned to bring pertinent, pragmatic, and global know-how across all aspects of commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Junior People Data Analyst to support accurate, timely and insightful people reporting across the organisation. This is an excellent opportunity to develop your skills in data analysis, HR systems, reporting and process improvement while working closely with stakeholders across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a point of contact for data, reporting and HRIS queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce accurate scheduled and ad-hoc reports for stakeholders across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extract, clean and transform data from multiple sources to prepare it for analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refresh and quality-check dashboards to ensure information remains current and reliable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse people data, highlighting relevant insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular data audits to identify and resolve inaccuracies in people systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support automation and process-improvement initiatives that reduce manual administration across the People Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Essential skills and experience&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be inquisitive and demonstrate a continuous improvement mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritise multiple tasks and manage competing deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working knowledge of Microsoft Excel, including formulas (VLOOKUP’s etc.) and data manipulation. Experience with Power Query, PivotTables or dashboard reporting would be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to exercise discretion and maintain a high level of confidentiality when handling sensitive information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build effective working relationships with key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Desirable skills and experience&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Power BI or a similar reporting or visualisation tool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of automation capabilities, such as Power Automate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using AI tools to support Excel analysis, reporting or basic coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG Ingenuity is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG Ingenuity is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG Ingenuity please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Optimisation Principal to lead experimentation-led growth (ELG) initiatives for our key global clients. In this role, you will define and execute data-driven growth strategies, champion a culture of continuous testing and learning, and integrate modern tech stacks to deliver measurable ROI and long-term business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Strategy &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Growth Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and deploy scalable Experimentation-Led Growth (ELG) frameworks, methodologies, and best practices tailored to client business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultivate Testing Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion an evidence-driven mindset across client organisations, shifting teams from basic A/B testing to sophisticated, hypothesis-led experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insights to Action:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead cross-functional teams in designing, executing, and analysing experiments, translating complex data into strategic growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Global Client &amp;amp; Stakeholder Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the principal advisor for all global optimisation activities, building trusted relationships with senior client stakeholders across diverse regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Storytelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver strategic forecasting, executive-level performance reporting, and actionable recommendations tied to core business KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Program &amp;amp; Commercial Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee global program operations, managing resources, timelines, and budgets to ensure on-schedule, in-scope execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Rigour:&lt;/strong&gt; Maximise resource allocation, monitor program throughput, and rigorously measure ROI to justify financial investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Technical Solution Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect integrated technical solutions, ensuring seamless interoperability across experimentation platforms, analytics suites, CMSs, CDPs, and personalisation engines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Guidance:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee technical planning and delivery to ensure underlying data pipelines and tools effectively support client growth targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visionary Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience leading global growth/optimisation strategies, driving organisational change, and managing multi-region client portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Technical Stack Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on mastery and architectural understanding of:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Adobe Target, Optimizely (client/server-side, statistical rigor).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; GA4, Adobe Analytics, Amplitude (segmentation, event tracking).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CDP &amp;amp; Personalisation:&lt;/strong&gt; Segment, Tealium, Dynamic Yield, Braze (data unification, activation, real-time engines).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CMS &amp;amp; Data Infra:&lt;/strong&gt; AEM, Sitecore, data warehousing, governance, and pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Statistical Rigour:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced proficiency in statistical analysis for A/B testing, data synthesis, and translating metrics into business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flawless Program Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability in Agile/Waterfall delivery, resource planning, risk management, and budget oversight for complex, global accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong influencer capable of uniting product, engineering, marketing, and data science teams around shared growth goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we can offer you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside the opportunity to work with some of the most exciting brands around the world, we’ll also prioritise your career development and help you grow your skills. We’ll empower you to make a difference, allow you to be yourself, and respect who you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent only:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a great benefits package including a discretionary bonus scheme, training opportunities, competitive pension, medical insurance, life assurance, social events, opportunities to buy and sell holidays, family friendly policies, discounts with hundreds of retailers and much more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We lead with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.&lt;br&gt;We empower your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Brains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.&lt;br&gt;And we champion&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Courage&lt;/strong&gt;, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp; WPP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; Enterprise Solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernisation, connecting strategy directly to execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX, work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We have received distinction as a leader in Commerce Services and CX Strategy Consulting by the Forrester Wave™&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
